# Arc 3 · Mission 5 — Counterselection. Evolved lineage 5, bred against lineages 0-4 with a
# novelty bonus that pushed it away from their style: it stays near home, attacks from one sub
# at a time with a clear numerical edge, and reinforces threatened subs. Wall board: a fortress
# forward of each home, two posts each side.

